<title>USA: St. John the Baptist Parish, La. won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>St. John the Baptist Parish, La. won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Sec. said it won</p>
<p>$2.700 million of St. John the Baptist Parish Sales Tax District,</p>
<p>La., public improvement revenue bonds, Series ST-1996 with a net</p>
<p>interest cost of 5.36 percent.</p>
</text>
